WEBVTT

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:05.800
Move the query and its new neighbors
carry more of the attention.

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:13.500
A smaller bandwidth makes the same
differences in distance count more.

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:20.500
A diagonal metric can make one
direction matter more than another.

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:29.200
KAM can retrieve from keys in the current context
and a separate bank of learned supports.
